hpc:WCKeyResponse a owl:Class .
hpc:WCKeyRemovedResponse a owl:Class .

hpc:hasId a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:WCKeyResponse ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:hasContent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Response ;
    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .

hpc:hasSchema a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Content ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Schema .

hpc:Schema a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf xsd:anyURI .

hpc:WCKey a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Response ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:WCKeyResponse ;

hpc:WCKeyRemoved a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Response ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:WCKeyRemovedResponse .

hpc:WCKeys a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Response .
```

This ontology fragment defines classes for `WCKeyResponse`, `WCKeyRemovedResponse`, and `WCKeys`, which are subclasses of `Response`. It also defines properties for `hasId`, `hasContent`, and `hasSchema`. The `hasSchema` property is used to link a `Content` instance to a `Schema` instance. The `Schema` class is defined as a subclass of `xsd:anyURI`.
